        "One barber.One chair.Your full attention.",
        "Chair and Blade is a private one-to-one barber studio in the heart of Manchester's Northern Quarter fringe. No queue, no rush — just a proper haircut, done properly, by appointment only.",
        "St John Street, Manchester"
      ]
    },
    {
