        "Every booking is a private, one-to-one slot — your appointment time is held for you alone. Card and cash accepted.",
        "Consultation, wash, precision cut and style, finished with a hot towel.",
        "Skin Fade & Tidy",
        "Clean skin fade blended into length on top, edged with a straight razor.",
        "Cut & Beard Sculpt",
        "Full haircut paired with a shaped beard trim, hot towel and oil finish.",
        "Beard Sculpt Only",
        "Shape, trim and straight-razor edging, finished with beard balm.",
        "Traditional Hot Towel Shave",
        "Full straight-razor shave, hot towels, pre-shave oil and balm finish.",
        "The Full Chair",
